+`BURST_IP_PREFIX`, `DEVICE_NEW_HIGH_RISK_ROUTE`, `CHALLENGE_FAILED_RECENT`, `ACCOUNT_STUFFING_PATTERN`, `KNOWN_BAD_ASN`.
+Operators can tune thresholds and immediately understand the blast radius.
