 ## Architecture
 
 ```mermaid
 flowchart LR
   C[Client] --> E["Edge (CDN/WAF)"]
-  E --> R["Risk Engine"]
+  E -->|sensitive routes / elevated risk| R["Risk Engine"]
   R --> H[(Redis: Hot Signals)]
